OL,3,GNEWSAJack-knifed lorry closes stretch
OL,4,Aof A38
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jack-knifed lorry has closed part of
OL,7,Fthe A38 in Derbyshire.
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police said the route was
OL,10,Fshut southbound between Little Eaton
OL,11,Fand Palm Court on Thursday afternoon.
OL,13,FThe road is likely to remain closed for
OL,14,F"some time", the force added.
OL,16,FDrivers are being asked to avoid the
OL,17,Farea and take alternative routes.
